EEXXAAMMPPLLEESS
     If you want to load _/_u_s_r_/_s_h_a_r_e_/_s_y_s_c_o_n_s_/_f_o_n_t_s_/_i_s_o_-_8_x_1_6_._f_n_t to the kernel,
